# The core pipeline needs NO credentials:
#   * NESO Data Portal is an open CKAN API (no key)
#   * Open-Meteo historical archive is keyless
#
# This file exists so the weather layer can later be swapped to the Met Office DataHub
# without code changes leaking secrets. If you enable that provider, copy this file to
# `.env` (which is git-ignored) and fill in:
#
# MET_OFFICE_API_KEY=your_key_here
